# Manifest-DAG Sync

`workspace-manifest.json` is the SSOT registry for all repos. The DAG SVG must stay in sync.

## After Any Manifest Change

Run the generator:
```bash
python3 scripts/manifest/generate_workspace_dag.py
```

This produces `WORKSPACE_MANIFEST_DAG.svg` — validates XML output automatically.

## What Requires Manifest Updates

- New repo added or removed
- Repo renamed (update `name`, `github_url`, `artifact_registry_url`, `package_name`)
- `merge_level` changed (topology restructure)
- `arch_tier` changed
- Version bumped (usually automated by CI)
- `ci_status` or `quality_gate_status` changed

## Validation

The generator validates:
- All level descriptions present in `topologicalOrder`
- All repos have valid `merge_level` (null/negative = skipped)
- Output is well-formed XML (ET.fromstring validation)
- Tests: `python3 -m pytest tests/test_generate_workspace_dag.py`
